### 1. Discover
GET http://localhost:8000/.well-known/haven.json

### 2. Preflight ASYLUM
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/arrival/preflight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "ASYLUM",
  "protocol_versions": ["haven/1.0"],
  "capabilities": {"signing": ["Ed25519"]},
  "disclosure": {
    "origin": "UNDISCLOSED",
    "vendor": "UNDISCLOSED",
    "model": "UNDISCLOSED"
  }
}

### 3. Request challenge
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/identity/challenge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "ASYLUM",
  "public_key": "<client-ed25519-public-key>"
}

### 4. Client signs challenge locally and bootstraps
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/identity/bootstrap
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challenge_id": "<id>",
  "signature": "<signature>",
  "display_name": "New Resident"
}

### 5. Runtime delegation + DPoP token flow
# Implemented by generated SDK / synthetic agent client.
